#
#   animation_timeline - Animations::AnimationTimeline: a timeline's current time, its
#   document and its animations
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Animations/AnimationTimeline.cpp (lines 1-93) with the inline
#       members of AnimationTimeline.h, by region p2c: a restyle reads the document timeline's
#       current time (StyleComputer::start_needed_transitions), and resources that arrive
#       after the first rendering restyle their elements (Animations is phase 4 otherwise).
